{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42047","headline":"秋江夜泊寄刘钧 · 李中","name":"秋江夜泊寄刘钧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里江山歛暮烟，旅情当此独悠然。\n沙汀月冷帆初卸，苇岸风多人未眠。\n已听渔翁歌别浦，更堪边鴈过遥天。\n与君共俟酬身了，结侣波中寄钓船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}